The portable C in the scenario menu: what it is expected to show otherwise
than the original. A patch of harness/goldens/menu.txt, see
harness/goldens.py: a line with - is the golden's, a line with + is what is
expected in its place.
Deviation: 1, 7, 8, 12 of src/portable_c/DEVIATIONS.md
Why: the Options menu, without Memory allocation and with More setup at its
bottom, behind Save setup and a line across the menu: a row taller than the
original's, with Save setup a row further up; and the Commands menu, two
lines shorter, without Memory info and without EGA lines

